@NexaStore.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5175

### AI provider status
GET {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assistant/status
Accept: application/json

### Single-agent identity, goals, and boundaries
GET {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assistant/agent
Accept: application/json

### MCP status and allowlisted capabilities
GET {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/mcp/status
Accept: application/json

### Knowledge-base status
GET {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/knowledge/status
Accept: application/json

### Ingest changed PDF documents (SHA-256 idempotent)
POST {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/knowledge/ingest
Accept: application/json

### Semantic vector search
GET {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/knowledge/search?query=What%20hardware%20is%20recommended%20for%20local%20LLMs%3F&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Stream a tool-grounded and RAG-grounded response
POST {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assistant/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "responseStyle": "balanced",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What hardware is recommended for running local LLMs? Cite the source."
    }
  ]
}

GET {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{NexaStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?ramMin=64&vramMin=16&aiReady=true
Accept: application/json

